&lt;p&gt;Beyond team leadership, you’ll act as a cross-functional connector, partnering closely with Marketing, Product, Operations, Finance, Legal, Revenue Operations, and Customer Success to ensure strategic alignment, remove roadblocks, and accelerate outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is more than a job&lt;/strong&gt;. It’s a high-impact opportunity for professional and financial growth, with competitive, performance-based compensation. It’s ideal for collaborative, entrepreneurial leaders who thrive in dynamic environments and value long-term customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
