he role for you.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>What you'll do</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Drive outbound prospecting by identifying and engaging decision-makers across SEO, marketing, and growth functions at companies that would benefit from Peec AI</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Execute personalized, high-quality outreach with cold calling at the core and email and LinkedIn in support, to generate qualified meetings and build pipeline for the Account Executive team</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Leverage AI-powered tools to research prospects, personalize messaging at scale, and continuously sharpen your outbound approach</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Collaborate closely with Sales and Marketing to refine targeting, messaging, and positioning based on what's resonating in the market</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Contribute to the development of outbound playbooks and prospecting approaches as the SDR function scales</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>What we're looking for</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hungry, driven, and relentlessly motivated, with a habit of setting ambitious targets and not stopping until you hit them</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A natural on the phone who genuinely enjoys cold calling and sees every dial as an opportunity, not a chore</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Passionate about technology and the role AI is playing in reshaping how businesses operate and grow, ideally someone who already uses AI tools as part of their day-to-day workflow</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Highly coachable and open to feedback, treating every conversation as a data point</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Excited about the opportunity to learn the full sales cycle and grow toward an Account Executive role over time</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>