1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own a real project. Ideally it’s the one you showed us. You take it from prototype to something our team or customers actually use.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work directly with the team. You work alongside Product, Engineering, or GTM, depending on where your project lives.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ship, measure, iterate. You present your progress regularly and decide based on real feedback.</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h2><strong>How to Apply</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Paste your Loom URL into the field “Your Build” in the application form. Your LinkedIn profile is enough; a CV is optional.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h2><strong>You Might Be a Fit If…</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You build, not just talk about AI. You have shipped things that work, even if they’re rough.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You think in impact, not just in technology.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You show high agency. You don’t wait for tasks; you find them.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You experiment constantly with new models and tools.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You communicate clearly and professionally in English. German is a plus.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You are kind and care about the people around you.</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h2><strong>What We Need</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Availability for a full-time internship of at least 6 months, 100% on-site in Berlin.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A work permit for Germany.</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h2><strong>The Environment</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will work fro