rren Strukturen, an effektives Arbeiten statt endlose Meetings — und daran, dass Nachhaltigkeit, Inklusion und Vielfalt keine Buzzwords sind, sondern gelebte Realität.</p><p></p><p><strong>Jede:r zählt</strong></p><p>Wir heißen willkommen, was dich einzigartig macht.</p><p>Bei der 7NXT Health Group glauben wir an Vielfalt, Offenheit und Teamgeist. Unabhängig davon, mit welchem Geschlecht du dich identifizierst, ob du eine Behinderung hast, wie dein Neurotyp ist, woher du kommst, woran du glaubst oder wie du liebst — du bist hier willkommen.</p><p>Erfüllst du nicht alle Kriterien? Kein Problem — wenn du die Zukunft von Gesundheit & Wohlbefinden mit uns gestalten möchtest, freuen wir uns auf deine Bewerbung.</p><p>Brauchst du einen barrierefreieren Prozess oder hast du Fragen? Schreib uns — wir finden einen Weg.</p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/7nxt-gmbh/junior-marketing-video-editor-berlin-396105","tags":["Marketing and Communication"],"job_types":["Befristeter arbeitsvertrag"],"location":"Berlin","created_at":1793922445},{"slug":"developer-c-net-as-freelancer-all-genders-berlin-436931","company_name":"Vexcash AG","title":"Developer C# / .NET as Freelancer (all genders)","description":"<h2>About Vexcash AG</h2><p>VEXCASH AG is Germany’s leading online provider of short-term loans. We offer our customers a quick and straightforward solution to bridge the gap until their next payday. More than 800,000 customers already rely on our service. Thanks to our innovative approach, they can secure financial liquidity without having to commit to a long-term agreement.</p><p>We are looking for an experienced Developer C# / .NET to join our team and contribute to the development of modern, reliable, and scalable web applications in the FinTech sector as Freelancer.</p><p>You will work in a skilled and collaborative environment using modern Microsoft technologies, primarily .NET 8+ and ASP.NET Core. Your main focus will be on designing and developing robust backend services, APIs, and data-driven applications while ensuring high standards of code quality, performance, security, and maintainability.</p><h2>Your responsibilities</h2><ul><li><p>Develop clean, maintainable, testable, and reusable C# code based on business requirements and user stories</p></li><li><p>Design, develop, and maintain backend applications and services using .NET 8+, ASP.NET Core, and Entity Framework Core</p></li><li><p>Design and implement RESTful APIs following best practices and scalable architecture principles</p></li><li><p>Work with SQL Server, including data modelling, query optimization, and performance tuning</p></li><li><p>Work with Entity Framework Core and ADO.NET for efficient data access and persistence</p></li><li><p>Implement automated unit and integration tests to ensure software quality and reliability</p></li><li><p>Apply software architecture principles, design patterns, and clean code practices</p></li><li><p>Collaborate using Git-based workflows and participate in code reviews</p></li><li><p>Contribute to CI/CD pipelines and automated deployments</p></li><li><p>Work with Microsoft Azure services and cloud-based architectures</p></li><li><p>Analyze, troubleshoot, and resolve technical, functional, and performance issues</p></li><li><p>Contribute to the continuous improvement of code quality, architecture, scalability, and development processes</p></li></ul><h2>What you bring</h2><ul><li><p>Strong professional experience with C# and the .NET ecosystem</p></li><li><p>Hands-on experience with .NET Framework, including maintenance and enhancement of legacy applications</p></li><li><p>Strong experience with .NET 8+ and ASP.NET Core for modern backend development</p></li><li><p>Solid experience with Entity Framework Core and ADO.NET</p></li><li><p>Proven experience designing and building RESTful APIs</p></li><li><p>Strong knowledge of SQL Server, relational database design, and query optimization</p></li><li><p>Good understanding of software architecture principles, design patterns, and clean code</p></li><li><p>Experience with automated testing frameworks such as xUnit, NUnit, or MSTest</p></li><li><p>Experience using Git in collaborative development environments</p></li><li><p>Familiarity with CI/CD pipelines and automated deployment processes</p></li><li><p>Experience with Microsoft Azure and cloud-based application architectures</p></li><li><p>Experience working in agile development environments</p></li><li><p>Strong analytical and problem-solving skills with a strong focus on code quality</p></li><li><p>Good command of English, German is a plus</p></li></ul><p>If you are motivated and want to be part of our success story, then send us your CV right away. If you hesitate, it’s your own fault!</p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":true,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/vexcash-ag/developer-c-net-as-freelancer-all-genders-berlin-436931","tags":["Remote","Software Development"],"job_types":["Freelancer / indepedent contractor","freelance","professional / experienced"],"location":"Berlin","created_at":1793905237},{"slug":"senior-enterprise-account-executive-55912","company_name":"Coveoen","title":"Senior Enterprise Account Executive","description":"&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn enterprise ambition into measurable impact with AI&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What if your next enterprise deal could transform how a leading organization in the DACH market connects with its customers? As a Senior Enterprise Account Executive on Coveo’s EMEA team, you’ll bring our AI-powered solutions to enterprise organizations across Germany, Austria and Switzerland, turning ambitious business priorities into measurable outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll own complex enterprise sales cycles from prospecting through close, combining your knowledge of the DACH market, consultative selling skills and a strong partner ecosystem to build trusted relationships and create long-term customer value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As one of our Senior Enterprise Account Executives, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and execute strategic account plans for enterprise organizations across the DACH market, identifying opportunities where Coveo can deliver measurable business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop trusted relationships with key decision-makers and senior executives, navigating complex organizations to create new opportunities and lasting partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate and develop your own pipeline while partnering with Coveo’s alliances team and broader partner ecosystem to uncover and accelerate opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop compelling business proposals that connect Coveo’s artificial intelligence capabilities to each customer’s priorities, challenges and potential business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage complex enterprise sales cycles end to end, assessing stakeholders, resources, timing, probability of closure and financial impact while maintaining accurate visibility into sales activity and results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead opportunities through negotiation and close, securing agreements and consistently working toward quarterly and annual sales quotas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here is what will qualify you for the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience managing complex enterprise software sales cycles in the DACH market, engaging stakeholders from business champions through senior executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional fluency in German and English, with the ability to build trusted relationships, lead business conversations and negotiate effectively in both languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong track record of generating your own enterprise opportunities and meeting or exceeding sales quotas in a results-driven environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A consultative and challenger-oriented sales approach, with the curiosity and discipline to understand sophisticated technology and translate it into clear customer value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will make you stand out:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling enterprise artificial intelligence, generative artificial intelligence or other sophisticated technology solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MEDDPICC certification or demonstrated experience applying the methodology to complex enterprise sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An established understanding of the DACH enterprise landscape and experience developing opportunities alongside strategic technology or consulting partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A humble, curious and creative mindset, paired with the drive to build trusted customer relationships across different organizations and markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do you think you can bring this role to life? Send us your application, we want to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Base Salary:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;100,000 EUR to 120,000 EUR&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note that the amount of the offer will depend on the candidate’s previous experience and skillset.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join the Coveolife!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We encourage all qualified candidates to apply regardless of, for example, age, gender, disability, gaps in CV, national or ethnic background.&lt;/p&gt;
