ilding solutions that you are proud to call your own</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Seal the deal</strong>: Collaborate with Data Analysts and Account Executives to secure deals with prominent e-commerce brands.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Leverage your tech knowledge:</strong> Assist prospects in integrating their data and user interfaces with our services, focusing on ETL and front-end integrations.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Deliver excellence:</strong> Validate the data provided by prospects and ensure the quality of the results returned by our services.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Empower a sales force:</strong> Contribute to the development and scaling of demo infrastructure to enhance the demo capabilities of the Sales team.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Be a part of the answer: </strong>Assist Account Executives by<strong> </strong>addressing technical inquiries from prospects about our services.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Elevate the team: </strong>Provide support to your teammates through thoughtful code reviews and empathetic problem solving sessions.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Visualize brilliance: </strong>Develop dashboards and alerts using React, Redux, Node, Clickhouse and OpenSearch.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Innovate with purpose: </strong>Implement and test new features for our open-source<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://github.com/Constructor-io/"> <u>JavaScript UI libraries and REST clients</u></a>.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Collaborative contribution:</strong> Steer cross-team efforts to ensure our prospect's needs are at the forefront of our priorities, making you a key player in our strategic success.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Champion team culture</strong>: Actively foster our team’s sense of community by e