he kind of work you'll still be proud of in ten years from now.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h2><strong>About the Role</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">We’re looking for a <strong>Full Cycle Technical Recruiter</strong> to own end-to-end hiring for Brain Co.’s Engineering teams (AI/ML, AI Product, AI Platform). You’ll partner closely with our in-house recruiting team and engineering leadership to attract and close world-class technical talent — the kind of people who define the next decade of applied AI.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">This isn’t a “req-filler” role. You’ll design and drive our recruiting engine — from crafting outbound strategies and refining our brand narrative to managing candidate experience and closing complex offers across global markets.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’ll be joining a high-trust, high-velocity environment where recruiting is seen as a strategic advantage — and your work will directly shape the caliber and trajectory of Brain Co.’s technical team.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h2><strong>You’ll Own</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Full-cycle recruiting across <strong>AI/ML, AI Product, and AI Platform</strong> roles — from sourcing to offer close</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partnering with leadership to define hiring needs and interview processes</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Driving candidate experience that reflects our speed, precision, and mission-driven culture</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Building market maps and data-driven sourcing strategies across competitive AI talent pools</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Negotiating complex offers and compensation packages in collaboration with execs and finance</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Serving as an ambassador for Brain Co.’s brand at events, conferences, and online communities</p></li></