ars&nbsp;of&nbsp;Medical Writing sales&nbsp;experience </p></li><li><p>Proven&nbsp;sales&nbsp;life&nbsp;cycle&nbsp;experience&nbsp;-&nbsp;lead&nbsp;generation&nbsp;through&nbsp;to business&nbsp;closing</p></li><li><p>Proven&nbsp;track&nbsp;record&nbsp;in&nbsp;achieving&nbsp;new business sales&nbsp;targets</p></li><li><p>Excellent&nbsp;problem-solving&nbsp;and&nbsp;analytical&nbsp;skills</p></li><li><p>Established&nbsp;capabilities&nbsp;managing&nbsp;complex,&nbsp;multi-stakeholder&nbsp;sales&nbsp;cycles</p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/transperfect/director-of-business-development-medical-writing-solutions-london-345780","tags":["Sales"],"job_types":["Mid","fulltime permanent"],"location":"London, Greater London, United Kingdom","created_at":1793957468},{"slug":"devops-engineer-london-116089","company_name":"Clariness","title":"DevOps Engineer (f/m/d)","description":"<p><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(230, 126, 35);"><strong>Clariness is looking for a DevOps Engineer (f/m/d) based in Berlin, Hamburg, Cape Town, UK, or Serbia.<br></strong><strong>- Full-time; unlimited -</strong></span></p>
