&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain reporting templates, adapting them as requirements change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather and analyse data for internal and client-facing reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create accurate, timely cost estimates for clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Logistics and Coordination&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
