&lt;li&gt;Work with Client&#39;s events team to organise travel and accommodation for attendees, making sure bookings meet current policy, budget and security requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Network Operations and Administration&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
