div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>A few figures illustrating our scale and ambition:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">💻 Over <strong>1.3 million SMEs</strong> already work with Pennylane</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">🤝 More than <strong>7,000 accounting firms</strong> use our platform</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 Over <strong>1,100 Pennylaners</strong> from more than 25 nationalities</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">💰 More than <strong>€400 million raised</strong> since launch</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">🌍 Remote-friendly, international culture expanding across Europe</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h2>What You’ll Do</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will lead our Website squad and collaborate closely with Growth, Product, Engineering, Sales, Demand Gen, Data, Brand, and Automation teams.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h3>Lead and Grow the Website Squad</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Set clear roles, objectives, and rituals</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Manage and develop multidisciplinary profiles across conversion, product, and engineering</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Foster growth in autonomy and seniority</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Integrate AI into daily work to accelerate processes (e.g., backlog management, landing-page creation)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Recruit additional talent as needed</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h3>Drive Conversion</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Define and prioritize initiatives that improve demo bookings and self-sign-ups</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Frame, challenge, and unblock projects while empowering owners</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Monitor conversion KPIs and ensure focus on measurable business impact</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Share results and learnings with Growth, Sales, and Product teams</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h3>Scale Experimentation</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Enhance the pace and quality of our A/B testing program</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Structure identification, prioritization, design, and analysis of hypotheses</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ensure statistical rigor and clear decision-making from experiments</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Make experimentation a consistent driver of website performance</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h3>Deliver Strategic Projects</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead brand redesigns and update commercial messaging</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support new product launches with self-sign-up journeys</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Prepare the website for international expansion</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Coordinate stakeholders, manage dependencies, and handle competing priorities</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h3>Protect Technical and Data Foundations</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with Engineering to ensure website performance, reliability, and security</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own tracking plan and conversion data quality</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Align Growth and Data teams on trusted metrics and reporting</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h2>What You Bring</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style