h the ability to leverage sales data and metrics for decision-making.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ability to work in a high-growth startup environment.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Nice to haves</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Big3/Big4 consulting experience or equivalent top-tier professional background is a strong plus.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience selling AI, GenAI, or ML products.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience in early-stage, fast-scaling startups.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Exposure to upselling, cross-selling, and customer success strategies.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Relationships in European broadcasters, streamers or sports media.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Existing network of enterprise clients or partners in SaaS/AI ecosystems.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>The deal</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Competitive base salary in USD.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Equity participation through the company's stock option program.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Based in Almaty (on-site; we sponsor and process your work permit, cover your flights, and provide temporary housing while you settle in) or remote in Europe, with regular travel across the region and to Almaty.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Our GTM team works six days a week and overlaps with US hours. Expect the same pace wherever you are based.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Full-time position.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Opportunity to become the cornerstone of Higgsfield's European sales engine.</p></li></ul><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/higgsfield/gtm-lead-europe-paris-248893","tags":["M