rd</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Solid knowledge of ATEX / IECEx, hazardous area classification and explosion-protection concepts</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience specifying and validating safety functions to ISO 13849 and/or IEC 61508</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Excellent technical writing: clear, structured, audit-ready technical files and manuals</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fluent English, written and spoken</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div></li></ul><h1><strong>Preferred qualifications and personal profile</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Nice to have</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Marine type approval with a classification society (DNV, LR, BV, ABS) or IGF Code projects</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with fuel processing, reformers or fire equipment, and with pressure equipment under PED</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Certified functional safety qualification or ATEX/IECEx competence certification</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Familiarity with North American codes (NEC, NFPA) and UL/CSA certification</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Personal profile</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Rigorous and structured, with a strong safety mindset and an eye for detail</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Pragmatic: finds compliant solutions that keep development moving</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Confident communicator with engineers, auditors, authorities and customers</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Self-driven in a fast-growing, scale-up environment; comfortable owning topics end to end</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Start date: Immediately</strong></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on