-studenten (op basis van 40 uur per week);</p></li><li><p>€ 400,- bruto per maand voor hbo-studenten (op basis van 40 uur per week);</p></li></ul></li><li><p>Een leerzame stage binnen één van de modernste en duurzaamste wasserijen van Europa;</p></li><li><p>Ruimte en begeleiding om te werken aan jouw (afstudeer)opdracht;</p></li><li><p>Persoonlijke begeleiding en korte lijnen;</p></li><li><p>Een familiaire en positieve sfeer: samen feestdagen vieren, een jaarlijkse familiedag en leuke uitjes;</p></li><li><p>Kans op een (bij)baan bij Nedlin na afronding van je stage, bij wederzijdse match.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong><span style="color:#00aca2">Veiligheid tijdens je stage</span></strong></p><p>Veiligheid staat ook tijdens de uitvoering van de stageopdracht voorop. Je voert daarom geen risicovolle onderhoudswerkzaamheden zelfstandig uit. Eventuele technische aanpassingen worden uitsluitend uitgevoerd door bevoegde medewerkers of externe partijen. </p> <br> <p><strong><span style="color:#00aca2">Wie ben jij?</span></strong></p><ul><li><p>Je volgt een mbo-opleiding, bijvoorbeeld Mechatronica, of Service en onderhoud elektrotechniek en instrumentatie.</p></li><li><p>Je werkt zelfstandig, nauwkeurig en proactief en communiceert gemakkelijk met collega’s.</p></li><li><p>Je bent 32 tot 40 uur per week beschikbaar voor een meewerkstage</p></li><li><p>Je kunt zelfstandig naar onze locatie in Elsloo of Hoensbroek reizen.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p><strong><span style="color:#00aca2">Pak het moment</span></strong></p><p>Wil jij tijdens je stage niet alleen werken aan een interessante opdracht, maar vooral ook leren, ervaring opdoen en jezelf ontwikkelen? Bij Nedlin krijg je de ruimte om jouw kennis vanuit je opleiding toe te passen in de praktijk, mee te kijken binnen onze organisatie en samen te werken met ervaren collega’s. Maak van jouw stage een waardevolle stap richting je toekomst. Solliciteer eenvoudig via de solliciteerknop. Heb je eerst nog vragen over de stage of de opdracht? Bel of app gerust via +31 (0)6 14 88 60 22 of mail naar <a rel="noopener" target="_blank" ---------- style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;"><strong><span style="font-size:1.2em"><span style="color:#00A49A">Onze sollicitatieprocedure</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><figure style="text-align:start;"><img style="width:2400px" src="https://recruitee-main.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/yb7kkfd559/Sollicitatieproces.jpg"></figure><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/nedlin/stage-technische-dienst-elsloo-of-hoensbroek-418445","tags":["Stages"],"job_types":["Student school","internship"],"location":"Elsloo of Hoensbroek, Limburg, Nederland","created_at":1793741469},{"slug":"stage-afdeling-hr-elsloo-220410","company_name":"Nedlin","title":"Stage: Afdeling HR","description":"<p><strong><span style="color:#00aca2">Over Nedlin</span></strong></p><p>Nedlin is een industriële textielverzorger voor Healthcare, Hospitality en Industry, waar veiligheid, kwaliteit, continu verbeteren en verantwoord ondernemen centraal staan. Als groeiend B-Corp familiebedrijf investeren we graag in jong talent en versterken we de verbinding tussen onderwijs en arbeidsmarkt. Daarom bieden we studenten de kans om praktijkervaring op te doen, zich te ontwikkelen en Nedlin te leren kennen, met waar mogelijk mooie doorgroeikansen na het afstuderen.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><figure><iframe height="281" width="500" src="//www.youtube.com/embed/t6e5SPJta2E"></iframe></figure><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong><span style="color:#00aca2">De stageopdrachten</span></strong></p><p>Bij de afdeling HR hebben we twee interessante stageopdrachten openstaan. Beide opdrachten zijn gericht op het slimmer, efficiënter en minder foutgevoelig maken van onze HR-processen. Samen kijken we welke opdracht het beste aansluit bij jouw opleiding, interesses en kwaliteiten.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>Opdracht 1: Optimaliseren van HR- en verzuimprocessen</strong><br>Binnen HR vinden veel mutaties plaats in Medicum, onze verzuimmonitor, en AFAS. Een deel van deze mutaties heeft direct invloed op de loonstroken en salarisbetalingen. Jij brengt het huidige proces in kaart en onderzoekt hoe we dit slimmer kunnen inrichten. Het doel is om processen beter op elkaar aan te laten sluiten, handmatige handelingen te verminderen en de kans op fouten bij salarisbetalingen te verkleinen.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Je houdt je onder andere bezig met:</p><ul><li><p>Het analyseren en in kaart brengen van de huidige processen en mutatiestromen;</p></li><li><p>Het signaleren van knelpunten en foutgevoelige stappen;</p></li><li><p>Het onderzoeken van mogelijkheden voor automatisering en procesverbetering;</p></li><li><p>Het uitwerken van een praktisch advies voor een efficiëntere werkwijze.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p><strong>Opdracht 2: Uitzendkrachtenproces &amp; managementinformatie</strong><br>Binnen Nedlin werken we samen met verschillende inhouse uitzendbureaus. Om inzicht te krijgen in de prestaties wordt managementinformatie momenteel grotendeels handmatig bijgehouden in een dashboard. Tijdens deze stage onderzoek je hoe we dit proces verder kunnen professionaliseren en automatiseren.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Je houdt je onder andere bezig met:</p><ul><li><p>Het in kaart brengen en verbeteren van het huidige uitzendkrachtenproces;</p></li><li><p>Het analyseren van de beschikbare managementinformatie;</p></li><li><p>Het onderzoeken hoe gegevens slimmer en meer geautomatiseerd kunnen worden verwerkt;</p></li><li><p>Het verbeteren van het dashboard en de betrouwbaarheid van de informatie;</p></li><li><p>Het opstellen van een advies waarmee HR beter en sneller inzicht krijgt in de prestaties van onze inhouse uitzendbureaus.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p><strong><span style="color:#00aca2">Wat bieden wij?</span></strong></p><ul><li><p>Stagevergoeding:</p><ul><li><p>€ 400,- bruto per maand voor hbo-studenten (op basis van 40 uur per week);</p></li></ul></li><li><p>Een leerzame stage binnen één van de modernste en duurzaamste wasserijen van Europa;</p></li><li><p>Ruimte en begeleiding om te werken aan jouw (afstudeer)opdracht;</p></li><li><p>Persoonlijke begeleiding en korte lijnen;</p></li><li><p>Een familiaire en positieve sfeer: samen feestdagen vieren, een jaarlijkse familiedag en leuke uitjes;</p></li><li><p>Kans op een (bij)baan bij Nedlin na afronding van je stage, bij wederzijdse match.</p></li></ul> <br> <p><strong><span style="color:#00aca2">Wie ben jij?</span></strong></p><ul><li><p>Je volgt een hbo-opleiding, bijvoorbeeld Commerciële Economie, Business Studies (richting HR), of International Business.</p></li><li><p>Je werkt zelfstandig, nauwkeurig en proactief.</p></li><li><p>Je communiceert gemakkelijk met verschillende collega’s.</p></li><li><p>Je bent 32 tot 40 uur per week beschikbaar voor een meewerk- of afstudeerstage.</p></li><li><p>Je kunt zelfstandig naar onze locatie in Elsloo komen.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p><strong><span style="color:#00aca2">Pak het moment</span></strong></p><p>Wil jij tijdens je stage niet alleen werken aan een interessante opdracht, maar vooral ook leren, ervaring opdoen en jezelf ontwikkelen? Bij Nedlin krijg je de ruimte om jouw kennis vanuit je opleiding toe te passen in de praktijk, mee te kijken binnen onze organisatie en samen te werken met ervaren collega’s. Maak van jouw stage een waardevolle stap richting je toekomst. Solliciteer eenvoudig via de solliciteerknop. Heb je eerst nog vragen over de stage of de opdracht? Bel of app gerust via +31 (0)6 14 88 60 22 of mail naar <a rel="noopener" target="_blank" ---------- style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;"><strong><span style="font-size:1.2em"><span style="color:#00A49A">Onze sollicitatieprocedure</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><figure style="text-align:start;"><img style="width:2400px" src="https://recruitee-main.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/yb7kkfd559/Sollicitatieproces.jpg"></figure><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/nedlin/stage-afdeling-hr-elsloo-220410","tags":["Stages"],"job_types":["Student college","internship"],"location":"Elsloo, Limburg, Nederland","created_at":1793741469},{"slug":"senior-pricing-analyst-amsterdam-195737","company_name":"Laka","title":"Senior Pricing Analyst","description":"<h3>👋🏻 Hello, we're Laka</h3><p>You might not have heard of us yet - that's OK, you've found us now - come and find out more about our journey...</p><p>Founded in 2017, Laka set out to transform insurance by connecting passionate cyclists to form a collective and protect their bikes for when things go wrong - a better model for insurance was born. For once people come first in insurance by fairly sharing the cost amongst each other. We exist to rewrite the rules of insurance so it’s something people stand with, not against.</p><p>Our model: Laka makes sure everything runs smoothly for The Collective - from exceptionally fast claims, splitting the cost fairly, guaranteeing a maximum price and all the other heavy lifting of a regulated insurance business. For that service, the collective pays Laka a fee relative to the claims in a month.</p><p>Take a closer look at exactly what this means and how it works <a href="https://laka.co/gb/" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external">here</a>.</p><p>What have we been up to since then...?</p><p>In a nutshell, we've been very busy! Here are a few of the massive achievements we've had:</p><p>🚀 Raised $10.4 million at series B!</p><p>🚀 Grown the team to over 60 Lakanauts, based across the UK and NL, enabling a choice-based, remote-first way of working</p><p>🚀 Launched Laka in a total of 11 countries, essentially helping more people in more places!</p><p>🚀 Captured the UK and NL enthusiast cyclist market and expanded into commercial business partnering</p><p>🚀 Been awarded 'Best Cycle Insurance Provider' (for the past 8 years in a row - go us! 🥳)</p><p>🚀 Opened 3 shiny new offices in London, Bristol &amp; Amsterdam to provide spaces for people to collaborate as they like</p><p>🚀 We've also achieved a 5* rating on Google Reviews and Glassdoor - go check us out!</p><p>Help us continue to change an outdated industry...</p><p>We’re growing real fast on our path to make the Laka collective model the industry standard and we’re expanding across segments, products, and territories. We’re looking for innovative, bold and brave minds to help us build the world’s best insurance company.</p><h3>🧮 Pricing at Laka</h3><p>Pricing our Collective is what makes Laka unique, so this role sits at the heart of what we do.</p><p>Each month, members pay their share of the Collective's claims and a fee for Laka's services, up to their own cap. A stop loss from our insurers picks up anything above the total of all caps. Pricing it well means keeping the Collective healthy while balancing the interests of our members, Laka and our insurance partners.</p><p>We have a fledgling pricing stack that we are looking to advance with your help.</p><h3>🤘🏼 The role</h3><p>You'll own pricing across all five markets and both sides of our business. One side is cyclists who buy from us direct. The other is the partners who sell or bundle our cover, from bike brands and retailers to leasing companies and delivery fleets. It's a broad, hands-on role, working with our Pricing Analyst.</p><p><strong>What you'll be getting up to:</strong></p><ul><li>Define and deliver pricing for our Collective in the UK and Europe: members' caps, rating factors and fees, based on claims frequency and severity by market and segment.</li><li>Price our partner business, from bike brands and retailers to leasing companies and fleets, and support our Commercial team on new deals and renewals.</li><li>Prepare rate reviews and pricing proposals for our insurance partners, and work with them on stop loss and capacity terms.</li><li>Develop our pricing stack, tools and processes with Engineering and Data.</li><li>Manage and develop our Pricing Analyst.</li></ul><p><strong>You'll be successful by:</strong></p><ul><li>Reviewing retail and partner pricing across all five markets in your first three months and agreeing priorities with us.</li><li>Taking the first cap and fee changes live, with proposals our insurers approve first time.</li><li>Taking our pricing stack to the next level within your first year.</li></ul><p><strong>Requirements</strong></p><p><strong>🚀 Sound like you? </strong></p><ul><li>👉🏻 This role will be a great fit if you:</li><ul><li>Have 6+ years' experience in insurance pricing, with rate changes you've designed and taken live.</li><li>Ideally have priced both direct-to-consumer and partner or B2B business: deep in one, credible in the other.</li><li>Build pricing models in code: GLMs and GBMs in Python, with SQL.</li><li>Are sharp and commercially minded, balancing growth, retention and profitability.</li><li>Can explain technical work simply to partners, insurers and our leadership team.</li><li>Have managed or mentored an analyst and are happy to stay hands-on.</li><li>Already use AI tools like Claude and Claude Code, or are keen to make them core to how you work.</li></ul><li><strong>Plus points:</strong></li><ul><li>Actuarial exams (IFoA, AAG, DAV or Institut des Actuaires): welcome, but not required. We care most about what you've priced.</li><li>Dutch, German or French.</li><li>An interest in cycling.</li></ul></ul><p></p><p><strong>Benefits</strong></p><p></p><h3><strong>🌟 Our perks</strong></h3><p>🏠 Remote-first way of working - you choose whether you work from home or our beautiful offices in London, Bristol and Amsterdam(we have no minimum expectation of how many days you come in, although we'd love to see your friendly face!)</p><p>📈 Share options - we want you to be rewarded for Laka's success - everyone in the business is granted share options when they join</p><p>💰 Performance driven scheme - if the company hits its targets, you'll get a cash bonus of 5% of your base salary annually</p><p>🌴 Annual leave - 25 days holiday (plus bank holidays), with the option to roll over up to 5 days per year</p><p>💶 Pension scheme - Laka pays 3% of your base salary into your pension to help you save for the future</p><p>💊 Private medical insurance - we’ll give you individual private cover, with the option to add partners &amp; dependants too (at a small cost)</p><p>🍽 Lunch on us - £15 every first Wednesday of the month to enjoy lunch on Laka - pop out locally with people in the office, or order-in at home, the choice is yours</p><p>💃 Company-wide events - we love getting everyone together as much as possible - expect regular events throughout the year, for team building, bonding, and general good old-fashioned fun!</p><p>🎳 Monthly socials - as if quarterly company events weren't enough, we also give each office a budget for a monthly social activity (think anything from low-key dinner &amp; drinks through to adventure golf, paddleboarding, bowling, electric darts, trampoline parks and more!)</p><p>👚 Laka swag - we'll give you some lovely Laka kit to get you started, including a jumper &amp; t-shirts so you can feel (&amp; look) like part of the family</p><p>🚴 Laka credit - for all you cyclists, we'll give you £10 credit per month towards insuring your bike(s) with us - plus give you access to a bunch of cycling industry discounts</p><p>🧠 Mental health support - unlimited support via Spill, including one-to-one therapy sessions</p><p>🌈 Belonging at Laka</p><p>We're committed to building and sustaining a business that promotes diversity, equity, inclusion and belonging - our customer collective is broad and inclusive, and we'd like our own people to be too. We're fast becoming a global community of people and we believe each person's unique qualities should be celebrated as they are a huge part of what makes Laka a great place to be. We'd love you to bring your authentic self to work every single day, no matter your age, ethnicity, religion, citizenship, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability status, caring responsibilities, neurodiversity, or anything else that makes you, you. If you’d like to request a reasonable adjustment as part of our application or assessment process, please let us know by emailing View email address on apply.workable.com</p><p></p><p>To find out more about what it’s like to work at Laka, visit our careers page <a href="https://laka.co/gb/careers" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external">here</a>.</p><p></p><p><em>Our customer collective is broad and inclusive, and we'd like our own people to be too. We continuously strive to build a diverse team from all backgrounds as we believe that varied experiences and perspectives makes the Laka collective even stronger. If you’d like to request a reasonable adjustment as part of our application or assessment process, please let us know by emailing </em><a ----- rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" -----<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/laka/senior-pricing-analyst-amsterdam-195737","tags":["Insurance"],"job_types":["Full time"],"location":"Amsterdam, Netherlands","created_at":1793733612},{"slug":"eerste-lijns-system-engineer-terneuzen-440839","company_name":"Progression IT Business Solutions B.V.","title":"Eerste lijns system engineer","description":"<p><strong>IT Medewerker – Eerste Lijns Service Engineer</strong></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>Ben jij die IT-held die energie krijgt van het helpen van mensen, houdt van virtuele omgevingen en SaaS-oplossingen, en een passie heeft voor techniek? Dan zouden we zomaar eens een match kunnen zijn.</strong></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Wie zoeken we?</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">We zijn op zoek naar een <strong>Eerste Lijns Service Engineer / Servicedesk Medewerker</strong> die klanten op een vriendelijke én deskundige manier verder helpt. Je bent het eerste aanspreekpunt bij IT-vragen of problemen . Zo weet je bijvoorbeeld wat het verschil is tussen een TAC en TAC 2 LAN netwerk of je kan rechten correct toewijzen in SharePoint. Je registreert en bewaakt meldingen in het systeem en zorgt voor een tijdige opvolging.</p><p class="MsoNormal">Daarnaast weet precies hoe je iemand geruststelt, duidelijk communiceert en snel tot de kern van het probleem komt. Tot slot wordt je soms ook betrokken bij installatie van hardware en software migraties. Een diverse en uitdagende functie dus.</p><p class="MsoNormal">Of je nu net van school komt of al wat meters hebt gemaakt in de IT: we horen graag van je.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Wie zijn wij?</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">Welkom bij <strong>Progression IT</strong>. Wij zijn een hecht en ambitieus IT-bedrijf uit Terneuzen, Zeeland. Al sinds 2005 helpen we onze klanten met slimme, veilige en toekomstgerichte IT-oplossingen. We doen dat met een enthousiast team van 25 collega’s – stuk voor stuk vakmensen met hart voor hun werk én voor elkaar.</p><p class="MsoNormal">Onze focus ligt op cloud- en hybride omgevingen. We werken met moderne tools en technologieën en zijn ISO27001-gecertificeerd. Dat betekent dat veiligheid bij ons geen bijzaak is, maar standaard in alles wat we doen.</p><p class="MsoNormal">En minstens zo belangrijk: naast hard werken, vinden we het ook belangrijk om lol te hebben. Zo lunchen we dagelijks samen (op kosten van de baas), ligt er altijd vers fruit klaar, en sporten we wekelijks onder begeleiding van een personal trainer. Een of twee keer per jaar trekken we eropuit voor een teamuitje – gewoon, omdat het gezellig is.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Wat ga je doen?</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">🔹 Klanten telefonisch en op afstand ondersteunen (±70%)<br>🔹 Complexere IT-vraagstukken oplossen (±20%)<br>🔹 Meewerken aan migraties en installaties van hardware (±10%)</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Kortom, je bent&nbsp;verantwoordelijk voor het beantwoorden van vragen, het oplossen van incidenten en het uitvoeren van wijzigingen. Je zorgt voor een tevreden klant door je&nbsp;uitstekende communicatieve vaardigheden (zowel mondeling als schriftelijk) met je&nbsp;goed humeur en klantgerichtheid.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p> <br> <p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Wat neem je mee?</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">✔️ MBO niveau 3 of 4, of vergelijkbaar werk- en denkniveau</p><p class="MsoNormal">✔️ Kennis van Microsoft 365, Windows10/11, Windows Servers &amp; Office 365</p><p class="MsoNormal">✔️ Basiskennis in netwerkbeheer<br>✔️ Je bent leergierig, hands-on en denkt in oplossingen<br>✔️ Je hebt affiniteit met ICT en vindt het leuk mensen te helpen<br>✔️ Je communiceert helder, zowel mondeling als schriftelijk<br>✔️ Klantgerichtheid zit in je DNA<br>✔️ Schoolverlaters? Ook welkom!</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Wat bieden wij jou?</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">💼 Een uitdagende functie in een groeiend IT-bedrijf<br>🧑‍💻 Direct klantcontact en afwisselende werkomgeving<br>🏠 Mogelijkheid om deels vanuit huis te werken<br>💸 Een passend salaris + goede arbeidsvoorwaarden<br>📱 Laptop én maandelijkse vergoeding voor internet &amp; telefonie<br>🔄 Vergoeding voor 24/7-diensten<br>🎯 Bonusregeling en ruimte om certificaten te behalen<br>🎉 Leuke collega’s met dezelfde passie voor IT<br>🍎 Gezonde lunches, fruit en wekelijks sporten met een personal trainer</p><figure><img src="https://bcontrol.brockmeyer.nl/track.php?orderid=39845"></figure><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/progression-it-business-solutions-bv/eerste-lijns-system-engineer-terneuzen-440839","tags":["ICT"],"job_types":["Mid","fulltime fixed term"],"location":"Terneuzen, Zeeland, Nederland","created_at":1793731887},{"slug":"global-senior-program-manager-almelo-192050","company_name":"Benchmark","title":"Global Senior Program Manager","description":"<p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8"><strong><em>Are you ready to lead complex engineering programs within the semiconductor industry? As Senior Program Manager, you drive multidisciplinary global projects from concept to delivery, working closely with leading customers, engineering teams and operations.</em></strong><span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8"><span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8">You will be responsible for the full lifecycle of development programs, from the initial customer request and concept phase through industrialization and customer delivery. Working closely with engineering, operations, supply chain and our customers, you ensure technical ambitions are translated into successful business outcomes.<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8"><span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8">Your main responsibilities are:<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW2545814 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8">Lead complex Design &amp; Engineering programs from concept development through manufacturing ramp-up and customer delivery.<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW2545814 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8">Drive program execution across multidisciplinary teams of up to 50 engineers located across multiple global Benchmark sites.<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW2545814 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8">Take ownership of program scope, planning, budget, risks and key decision-making throughout the entire lifecycle.<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW2545814 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8">Align technical experts, project leaders and stakeholders around shared goals, priorities and deliverables.<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW2545814 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8">Work closely with operations, supply chain and external partners to ensure products are ready for successful industrialization and production.<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW2545814 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8">Act as the primary point of contact for customers, providing clear communication on progress, risks, decisions and their business impact.<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW2545814 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8">Create structure, alignment and momentum in technically complex environments where customer expectations, engineering challenges and business objectives come together.<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8"><span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8">This role offers a unique opportunity to work at the forefront of semiconductor technology, leading strategic programs that have a direct impact on both our customers' success and Benchmark's future growth.<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8"><span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8"><strong><span style="color:#2F5496">Why do you want this position?</span></strong><span style="color:#2F5496">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8">Because few roles offer this combination of technical complexity, global collaboration and strategic impact. You will lead high-profile semiconductor programs, work directly with industry-leading customers, and drive the successful delivery of innovative products from concept through manufacturing, leaving a visible mark on both our organization and the future of semiconductor technology.<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8"><span style="color:#2F5496">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8"><strong><span style="color:#2F5496">What do we offer?</span></strong><span style="color:#2F5496">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8">At Benchmark, you work on products that truly matter. We are an organization where you are given freedom, where entrepreneurship is rewarded, and where you have the opportunity to turn your ideas into reality. We offer a dynamic environment with plenty of room to grow, take ownership, and advance your career. You will be part of a global company while still enjoying the down-to-earth culture that Twente is known for.<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8">At Benchmark, you will find challenging work, a high level of trust, and extensive opportunities for personal and professional development. You will work alongside pragmatic colleagues in an informal culture, supported by attractive employment conditions that enable long-term success.<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8">In addition, we offer:<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW2545814 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8">A competitive salary of up to €9,000 gross per month, based on full-time employment, depending on your experience, expertise, and background.<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW2545814 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8">revenue-based quarterly bonus scheme with a maximum payout of 5% of your quarterly salary.&nbsp;<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW2545814 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8">Enjoy 40 days of paid leave per year (27 vacation days plus 13 additional ADV days).<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW2545814 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8">Personal growth and development, with a tailored development path that aligns with your ambitions and the needs of the business.<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW2545814 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8">Flexibility in how you organize your workweek, enabling you to balance work and personal life in a way that works for you.<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW2545814 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8">A strong engineering-driven knowledge culture, where collaboration, knowledge sharing, and innovation are central. Through initiatives such as Lunch &amp; Learn Sessions and Pitch Discovery Sessions, you will have ample opportunities to learn, inspire others, and develop new ideas.<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8"><span style="color:#2F5496">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8"><strong><span style="color:#2F5496">Who are you?</span></strong></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8">Whether you're already leading large-scale engineering programs or ready to take on a broader strategic role, you thrive in complex, technology-driven environments. You know how to align stakeholders, manage competing priorities, and guide multidisciplinary teams towards a common goal. With your leadership skills, business acumen and ability to bring structure to complexity, you successfully translate ambitious plans into tangible results.&nbsp;<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8"><span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8">Furthermore, we are looking for:<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW2545814 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8">7+ years of experience leading complex technical programs in a high-tech semiconductor environment, preferably within system development and with a background in mechatronics or mechanical engineering.&nbsp;<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW2545814 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8">Strong leadership and stakeholder management skills, with the ability to align multidisciplinary teams around common goals and priorities.&nbsp;<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW2545814 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8">Proven track record in delivering complex systems and development programs, from concept and design through industrialization and customer delivery.&nbsp;<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW2545814 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8">Strong technical affinity, capable of translating engineering challenges into clear plans, decisions and results.&nbsp;<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW2545814 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8">Excellent communication and problem-solving skills, combined with the flexibility to thrive in a fast-paced international environment and willingness to travel.<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8"><span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8">If you're excited by the challenge of leading global semiconductor programs at the forefront of technology, we cannot wait to get in touch!<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8"><span style="color:#2F5496">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8"><strong><span style="color:#2F5496">Serious Tech</span></strong><span style="color:#2F5496">&nbsp;<br></span>At Benchmark, you work on products that make a real impact through innovation, whether by improving safety, enhancing healthcare, or making everyday life easier. From product design and engineering to volume production and, in some cases, direct delivery to end users, the entire process takes place at our Almelo facility, where you will work alongside approximately 650 colleagues.<span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8"><span style="background-color:#C6C6C6">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW2545814 BCX8">We develop and manufacture innovative solutions for industries including semiconductor, healthcare, aerospace, and industrial markets. From concept to production, the complete product lifecycle comes together under one roof. While the techn